    <instruction>21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28, 29, and 30 Find the Taylor series for $$f(x)$$ centered at the given value of $$a$$ . [Assume that $$f$$ has a power series expansion. Do not show that $$\left. R_{n}(x)\rightarrow 0 \right.$$ .] Also find the associated radius of convergence.</instruction>
