      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$50 + 105\left( {x - 2} \right) + 92\left( {x - 2} \right)^{2} + 42\left( {x - 2} \right)^{3} + 10\left( {x - 2} \right)^{4} + \left( {x - 2} \right)^{5},R = \infty$$</paragraph>
