    <instruction>51, 52, 53, and 54 Find the Maclaurin series of $$f$$ (by any method) and the associated radius of convergence. Graph $$f$$ and its first few Taylor polynomials on the same screen. What do you notice about the relationship between these polynomials and $$f$$ ?</instruction>
